    "body": "Thanks @Uncreativ-e, I slightly modify your solution to fix the white space after the path to belong to the link.\nI removed the trailing white space from the default directory format\n```toml\nformat = '[$path]($style)[$read_only]($read_only_style)' # instead of the default '[$path]($style)[$read_only]($read_only_style) '\n```\nand add it to the end sequence\n```toml\n[custom.pwd_link_end]\nformat = \"\\u001b\\\\]8;;\\u001b\\\\\\\\ \" # instead of \"\\u001b\\\\]8;;\\u001b\\\\\\\\\" \nwhen = true\n```",
